A515 - It often happens that certain intelligent and valid concepts can be reused in other contexts. For example, in software development there are 'design patterns' recognized for their usefulness. In addition to software, they can also be used as reasoning models. For example, the 'Decorator' pattern and 'Wrapping a gift' are applications of the same concept. The 'Composite' pattern and the 'Box' concept, are the same concept, etc...